## 📌 Project Overview  
This project is a **Handwritten Digit Recognition System** that uses a **Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)** trained on the **MNIST dataset**.  
It provides a **Tkinter-based GUI** where you can draw digits and get instant predictions.  

✅ Train your own CNN  
✅ Predict digits in real time  
✅ Extend with webcam input using OpenCV  

