## ⚙️ Setup Instructions  

```bash
# 1️⃣ Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/rohith-1008/Handwritten-Digit-Recognition-System.git
cd Handwritten-Digit-Recognition-System

# 2️⃣ Create a Virtual Environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # (Linux/Mac)
venv\Scripts\activate      # (Windows)

# 3️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

🏋️‍♂️ Training the Model
python train_model.py


✅ Downloads MNIST dataset
✅ Trains a CNN model
✅ Saves model as mnist_cnn.h5

🖥 Run the GUI
python gui_predict.py


🖌 Draw a digit with mouse
🔮 Press Predict → see the model output instantly

📌 Notes & Improvements

✨ Train with more epochs for better accuracy

✨ Add data augmentation to improve generalization

✨ Use OpenCV webcam input: capture frame → grayscale → resize (28×28) → predict

✨ Export model as TensorFlow SavedModel or TensorFlow Lite (TFLite) for mobile deployment

